OL,3,GNEWSAMP urged to learn city's
OL,4,Apronunciation by expert
OL,5,
OL,6,FA speech and language therapist has
OL,7,Fencouraged Angela Rayner to educate
OL,8,Fherself on the pronunciation of
OL,9,FWorcester after the MP struggled with
OL,10,Fthe word while addressing Parliament.
OL,12,FThe local government secretary
OL,13,Freferenced the city as "Wurchester" in
OL,14,Fher speech announcing a review of the
OL,15,Flocal government reorganisation plans
OL,16,Fon Monday.
OL,18,FHazel Shaw, who owns a private practice
OL,19,Fin Worcester, said it was a "brilliant
OL,20,Fexample" of how speech and spelling do
OL,21,Fnot always match.
OL,23,APub: 10-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
